 [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ct[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ct/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render-time link records in the code catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]links-catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]links-catalog: extend the render-time catalog filter to record every URI[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link (exact target, text, autolink flag, lead-in context, section) with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an invisible inline PDF anchor for its page, store them as an additive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`links` array in code.json, and apply the bare_urls reader decision.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob ref links read surface[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]links-cmd[dim] · [dim][/dim]after links-catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]links-cmd: add the read-only `bob ref links <REF> [N]` command (human, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]json, markdown, raw; page filter) with bob-computed label, site, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Markdown forms, golden-tested, with completion, catalog, help, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Annotation pages, attach-source links, and bob ref recatalog[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]recatalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after links-catalog, links-cmd[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]recatalog: map links to pages from an existing PDF's link annotations, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record links in attach-source, add `bob ref recatalog` and the doctor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]count, then act on the backfill decision on athena.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]RefsCore link catalog, L row, and the link picker model[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after links-cmd[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-core: decode `bob ref links`, add the L row, its key resolution, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loading queue and hidden reasons, the Option-U Markdown-link alternate, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a pure link picker plus link preview model, all unit-tested with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]portable-check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Link picker, link well, and panel wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-ui: fetch links beside code when the Copy card opens, draw the L [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row, the link picker rows, and the link well in light and dark, extend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the design fixtures and docs, and run the Mac acceptance.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ct","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ct.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-47824982dc989709027ca9b99cda1d7f","started_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:17.448966+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"6940c5712ac8798c1dc5645e588377720001e26e0554987a6111e360519f564a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ct.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ct.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"72e57b1f19acfaec6d65b1009a370772de0d4890